    description: "Function references in non-call contexts. Fixed: Java method_reference (PR #1372), Kotlin callable_reference (PR #1372), Go struct_field_reference (PR #1365), Python dict/variable/argument/list references (PR #1373), Ruby method(:name) (PR #1374), Scala eta-expansion (PR #1374), C &function pointer (PR #1375), C++ &function/&Class::method pointer (PR #1375). Remaining: Groovy .& (grammar gap in tree-sitter-groovy, produces ERROR nodes), C#/Swift method references (not yet investigated)."  # 6db0
